### Demo scenario - run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman / curl.
@api = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Instruments (REST -> gRPC ListInstruments)
GET {{api}}/instruments

### 2. Create a portfolio
POST {{api}}/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Alice", "initialCash": 10000 }

### 3. Buy 10 BNP at market price (REST -> gRPC GetQuote)
POST {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "BNP", "side": "BUY", "quantity": 10 }

### 4. Portfolio valued at current prices
GET {{api}}/portfolios/1/valuation

### 5. Sell 4 BNP
POST {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "BNP", "side": "SELL", "quantity": 4 }

### 6. Order history
GET {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders

### --- Error cases handled by the exception handler ---

### 400 - invalid body
POST {{api}}/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "", "initialCash": -5 }

### 404 - unknown portfolio
GET {{api}}/portfolios/999

### 404 - unknown symbol (gRPC NOT_FOUND translated to HTTP 404)
POST {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "XXX", "side": "BUY", "quantity": 1 }

### 422 - insufficient funds
POST {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "MC", "side": "BUY", "quantity": 1000 }

### 422 - selling more than held
POST {{api}}/portfolios/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "symbol": "BNP", "side": "SELL", "quantity": 1000 }

### 503 - stop market-service, then:
GET {{api}}/instruments

### Delete the portfolio
DELETE {{api}}/portfolios/1
